{"id":"c921a3191bc6f9f0","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-terms-compat.md","title":"fhodtt-terms — 项和转换规则的历史入口","display":"fhodtt-terms — 项和转换规则的历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fhodtt-terms-compat","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-terms-compat","16-fhodtt-terms"],"display":"fhodtt-terms — 项和转换规则的历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]"],"review_status":"source-rule-core-reconstructed","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J04","review_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§11.5, p. 688 (PDF 708); §11.4, pp. 674–676 (PDF 694–696)","review_scope":"Compatibility alias for reconstructed terms and beta/eta","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-terms-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-terms-compat</span><span>16-fhodtt-terms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fhodtt-terms — 项和转换规则的历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-rule-core-reconstructed"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J04"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.5, p. 688 (PDF 708); §11.4, pp. 674–676 (PDF 694–696)"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Compatibility alias for reconstructed terms and beta/eta"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\">\\(\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a> 定义的项及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span> 规则集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\)</span> 是其中连同形成、结构规则给出的有限推导 judgment 集。上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{legacy}\">\\(\\mathrm{legacy}\\)</span> 区分历史拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TermRules}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}},\\qquad\n\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TermRules}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}},\\qquad\n\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：§11.5，p. 688（PDF 708）及 §11.4，pp. 674–676（PDF 694–696）。旧入口引用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TermRules}\">\\(\\mathsf{TermRules}\\)</span> 现在已有定义；尤其保留强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\">\\((\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\)</span>-和与另外三种很强和的消去差异。</li>\n<li>多型相等是另选规则包的扩展，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的引入不是 equality reflection。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}$ 是 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义的项及 $\\beta/\\eta$ 规则集合；$\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}$ 是其中连同形成、结构规则给出的有限推导 judgment 集。上标 $\\mathrm{legacy}$ 区分历史拼写。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"多型相等是另选规则包的扩展，见 [[16-df-identity-type]]；$r$ 的引入不是 equality reflection。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta/\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{legacy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TermRules}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}},\\qquad\n\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TermRules}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false}],"bytes":1491,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-terms-compat|fhodtt-terms — 项和转换规则的历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["3930e297a315728a","5c7f9132ab843c91"]}